WEBVTT

00:26:00.036 --> 00:26:01.716
I mean, based on no data.

00:26:01.756 --> 00:26:04.916
But once it gets into the social media,

00:26:04.956 --> 00:26:08.316
it explodes and conspiracy
theories explode.

00:26:08.356 --> 00:26:11.836
Even though all of the evidence
proves it wrong,

00:26:11.876 --> 00:26:15.916
proving something wrong today
doesn't seem to matter much.

00:26:17.276 --> 00:26:20.156
That's really strange and weird,
isn't it, David?

00:26:20.196 --> 00:26:21.476
DB: Yeah, yeah.

00:26:21.516 --> 00:26:25.356
Well, it's, I think, an old phenomenon.

00:26:26.196 --> 00:26:28.996
There's a famous saying
that I'm going to mangle about

00:26:29.036 --> 00:26:31.196
by the time the truth
gets out of the barn,